ConvexInterface -- Interface to the Maple package Convex.
*********************************************************

Description
===========

What's new:

July 13, 2010: Added a function *note mIsSubcone: mIsSubcone, testing whether a
cone is a subcone of another one.

October 4, 2009: Added a generic function *note callConvex: callConvex, taking
a string with a program written in Convex syntax.

September 20, 2009: Added functions *note mPosHullFaces: mPosHullFaces, and
*note mPosHullFacesAndDuals: mPosHullFacesAndDuals, to compute the face complex
of a cone. They have an *note Option: (Macaulay2Doc)Option, *note toFile:
toFile, to store the result of a computation in a file, and a function *note
readPosHullFaces: readPosHullFaces, to read the file.

September 10, 2009: Added a function *note mLatticePoints: mLatticePoints, to
compute the lattice points of polytope.

August 28, 2009: The interface now uses indexed vertices. This substantially
improves computation time and memory usage.

August 25, 2009: Added an *note Option: (Macaulay2Doc)Option, *note toFile:
toFile, to *note mConvexHullFaces: mConvexHullFaces, and *note
mConvexHullFacesAndDuals: mConvexHullFacesAndDuals, to store the result of a
computation in a file, and a function *note readConvexHullFaces:
readConvexHullFaces, to read the file.

Overview:

The goal of this package is to provide the functions of the Maple package
Convex in Macaulay 2.

The Convex package is distributed by Matthias Franz under the GNU General
Public License, see

http://www.math.uwo.ca/~mfranz/convex

for more information.

ConvexInterface is work in progress and so far accesses only a fraction of the
functionality provided by Convex. If you would like to help to expand this you
are welcome.

Note that there is a generic function *note callConvex: callConvex, with takes
a String containing a program written in the Syntax of Maple/Convex.

Functions:

So far the following functions are accessible via ConvexInterface:

*note mConvexHullFaces: mConvexHullFaces,  -- compute the faces of a convex
hull

*note mConvexHullFacesAndDuals: mConvexHullFacesAndDuals, -- computing the
faces and their duals

*note mHomology: mHomology, -- Compute the homology of a (not necessarily
simplicial) complex

*note mLatticePoints: mLatticePoints, -- computing the lattice points of a
convex hull

*note mPosHullFaces: mPosHullFaces,  -- compute the faces of a positive hull

*note mPosHullFacesAndDuals: mPosHullFacesAndDuals, -- computing the faces and
their duals of a positive hull



